{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e4a303457a5cf5348a989c0a1963417391ceea48beca1b3664044683e5c85810",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5d6d1330239f06531c8a15094e7dd830199e1cb732f1224432fbf4c33416661",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n今天是白色情人节对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b85f66cd7a1ed0f815b1a68ae96d1c1e43a1f2756b28f2fa925c45ebc014d26f",
      "text": "这个，是我送你的回礼。\n收下吧……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd84a7af8e31f964a41837fb2099fa83bdd3081697506e8a6da0c5a03b4847a9",
      "text": "非常感谢你，朱雀先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f489354d0a90fb0ac995698baafb69f78219c2753c2f5c7b58a161263fe8510",
      "text": "呼，今年也顺利交到你手上了真是太好啦！\n然后呢，这边这盒点心是喵子送你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56e97298fe72af373daa46efca7073dd73703fd054f78d6f2b229e164e49e34",
      "text": "喵子也为我准备了点心吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f265fa76c44b4556ce2cb3123e1ba8e74e91b9eb908f68326cf3354c0eff6097",
      "text": "噢！我在纠结选哪个好时，\n喵子就指了这盒！对吧，喵子？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17ee4f78a2a4fdb5bf5c8b05cd961ab309c9358bcd64e0d8b8a9738ca861979",
      "text": "喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:770627cc52258ccf6d0f2855d8ba8bbcf320841bb8751cb00d4c0b6365d52c5b",
      "text": "喵子，非常感谢你！\n两盒点心我都会好好珍惜着吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3473983421732c179527676d0ea617a7e6114e74fa7b704d56abbc3fab89b2a5",
      "text": "噢！两样都超级美味的，\n你就满怀期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_23_5_02_025_23:5_02_025_23:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:319cc15ca1957070a8fa9c18faaaeb260cadb756dc6297746d71a9488ce9437b",
      "text": "要是我和喵子的热烈心意\n能好好传达到制作人那里，那就太让人高兴啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
